      "name": "Antigravity CLI",
      "date": "Mar 2026 – Mar 2026",
      "description": "Antigravity CLI is a local OpenAI-compatible API server and web dashboard that unlocks premium AI models.Problem it solves: Many developers do not have the budget for expensive API keys. This tool allows developers to use their existing Google One AI Premium subscription to access top-tier models like Claude Opus and Gemini Pro directly in their favorite tools (personal projects, terminal, open claw, basically anywhere that accepts openai compatiple apis) without paying per-token API costs.Features:- Full Web Dashboard & API Tester- Multi-Account Rotation (combines total quota)- Real-time API Streaming- 19 Live Models as offered by antigravityDisclaimer & Warning: This project is for personal and educational use only. It requires an active Google One AI Premium subscription and relies on local OAuth credentials. Do not share your keys.json file.",
