      "date": "Sep 2023 – Dec 2023",
      "description": "Built a vision-based humanoid robotic palm that mirrors human hand gestures in real time, aimed at low-cost prosthetic assistance for amputees.A camera feed is processed by a deep learning model that classifies hand landmarks and gestures; the predicted pose drives servo actuators on a 3D-printed palm through a microcontroller. Published as an IEEE paper (Mar 2024).Tech: Python, OpenCV, deep learning / neural networks, Raspberry Pi, servo control.",
      "source": "linkedin-projects-before.yml",
      "verified": false,
      "evidenceStatus": "profile-reported"
