    {
      "name": "Vinsta - Social Media App using MERN Stack",
      "date": "Sep 2023 – Oct 2023",
      "description": "I successfully completed the development of \"Vinsta,\" a social media platform, as a course project for a web development course. This project, inspired by the YouTube video tutorial by CodersNeverQuit, was constructed using the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React, and Node.js) and using Cloudinary plaform for storing the media(photos) on cloud. \"Vinsta\" encompasses essential features such as user registration, profile management, personalized news feeds, post creation, social connections, likes, and comments. Frontend used \"materialize-css\"for styling and on the server side, dependencies like \"bcryptjs,\" \"express,\" \"jsonwebtoken,\" \"mongoose,\" and \"nodemon\" ensured the seamless operation . This project provided me with valuable hands-on experience in working with the MERN stack, which is widely employed in modern web application development. I am immensely thankful to Prof. Archana Choudhary for her guidance and for providing me with the opportunity to work on this project.",
